  "title": "Smoked Salmon Pesto Pasta",
  "description": "Tasty bits of smoked salmon are simmered in a delectable sauce of onions, mushrooms and garlic, tomato paste, basil and a good measure of rich, nutty pesto. Serve over hot noodles for a very impressive salmon and pesto pasta.",
